    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923420/extras/31913a1ab413f38809a953e167495f80.webp?t=1716570072\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br>A little story about obsession and personal growth. And sex.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Premise</h2><strong>Errol</strong> is a ghost with one thing on his mind: losing his virginity. He refuses to join the afterlife until he has scored with a woman. But after doing just that, he is still stuck in the world of the living...<br><br><strong>Vivienne</strong>, Errol's roommate, recruits the help of <strong>Anita Dicking</strong>, a medium, biographer, podcaster, and unlicensed therapist. Together they review the events leading to Errol's big triumph to see if they can discover what's truly anchoring him to the world of the living...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Super short VN game. Somewhere around 30 minutes or less. <br></li><li>Linear story. None of those pesky multiple choices, empty open worlds, or free will.<br></li><li>The story unfolds in short chapters that can be revisited if you'd like.<br></li><li>Learn the art of Seduction from a ghost who spent over 100 years trying to get laid.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sexy Stuff</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Voyeurism<br></li><li>Assisted masturbation<br></li><li>Vanilla sex</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Less Sexy, Technical Stuff</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Interview with the Horny Ghost is as free as it is short: VERY! Love it, or your money back...<br></li><li>Feedback (and praise) is certainly appreciated!<br></li><li>If you'd like to support us, consider purchasing the <i>Goodie Package</i> DLC</li></ul>",
